+initialized, disposable PostgreSQL 17 clusters, not merely two databases in one
+cluster. PostgreSQL roles are cluster-global, and each forward migration
+requires the claim roles to be absent. Neither URL may point to FanMind
+production under the current authorization. Each `ARTIFACT_DIR` must name a new,
+non-existing local directory so raw output and the harness exit code cannot be
+overwritten by a later run.
 
